/* TEXT-SAFE accents. Cyan is a SURFACE colour on paper (1.4:1 as text). --hy-acc = accent for small TEXT: cyan mixed 62% toward ink on paper / white plates; the cyan itself on night and graphite; ink on the cyan band. --hy-acc-lg = accent for LARGE display text only (>=24px): 50% cyan on paper. --hy-mut = muted text (>=5:1 on every ground). */
